{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Our steps</b> — The word עם or לפאת is missing. Thus the sense is: \"They have compassed us לפאת our steps; their eyes they set, to cast down our steps in the earth,\" like \"if you turn aside your steps from the way.\""], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:26.240651466Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}